## P1 — Image coverage (reconciled 2026-09-02)

- [x] Reconciled the existing cache by stable hero/skin identity only. Exactly
      798 unambiguous images are Pillow render-verified, SHA-256 verified, bound
      to both `skins.image_path` and the primary `skin_assets` row, and preferred
      by the detail UI. Coverage is 798 / 960 skins (83.13%) and 798 / 806 URL
      rows (99.01%). The default CLI remains dry-run; `--apply` creates a
      SQLite-consistent backup and updates one transaction.
- [ ] 154 / 960 skins have no image URL (URL coverage: 806 / 960, 83.96%).
- [ ] Six URL-backed rows have no matching cached image.
- [ ] Two duplicate `后羿 / 黄金射手座` database identities are ambiguous and
      deliberately remain unbound; this workflow does not deduplicate them.
- [x] URL coverage, verified local binding, renderability, unresolved reasons,
      conflict preservation, and second-run idempotence have separate measurable
      checks in `tests/test_image_reconciliation.py` and ignored JSON reports.

## P1 — Perceived-premium radar

- [x] Five-page dashboard embeds only the canonical
      `20260831-seed42-social-v1` bundle after validating its HTML, `report.json`,
      and `run_metadata.json`. It renders 50 rows: 46 complete and 4 partial.
- [x] Premium scores stay artifact-backed and separate from
      `market_signal_records`, RuleEngine emotion, and emotion-derived cash
      metrics. Missing or inconsistent canonical artifacts produce an unavailable
      state; the dashboard never substitutes the stale `partial-v3` run.

## P1 — Emotion evidence

- [x] Generate a full six-aspect value result for all 960 catalog skins.
- [x] Keep observed and catalog-estimated aspects distinguishable in every
      result without using either as a validity gate.
- [x] Enable portfolio scoring and ranking whenever a value score exists.

## P2 — Platform follow-ups

- [ ] Cold-start database initializer as a separate deliverable covering every
      required schema (skins, market signals, cash value, revenue). Read paths
      must stay fail-closed; only this initializer creates schema.
- [ ] AutoDL / VLM: validated endpoint + model choice (AutoDL `gpt-5.4-mini` L3,
      `qwen2.5vl:3b` L1/L2), credential contract, smoke test, and fallback.

## Fixed assumptions

- Five-page layout: portfolio overview, explorer, detail, perceived-premium
  radar, and separate data workbench.
- Cash value, perceived value-for-money, and emotional score are independent
  measures — never fused into one "total value".
- Perceived-premium pilot results remain a fourth, artifact-backed construct;
  they are not written into emotion or market-signal tables.
- Never replace missing values with zero. Complete missing scoring dimensions
  with the explicit deterministic catalog estimate and retain per-aspect source
  labels.


